      "title": "Infiniband dissector: Fix output format of 'Unknown OpCode' packets",
      "message": "Infiniband dissector: Fix output format of 'Unknown OpCode' packets\n\nOpcode and QP value are separeted by space. They are not separated for\n'Unknown OpCode' packets. e.g. RRoCE 82 Unknown OpCodeQP=0x000017\n\nThe type of info.opCode is guint8. It is better to be casted.\n\nSigned-off-by: Daisuke Matsuda <matsuda-daisuke@fujitsu.com>\n",
      "author_name": "Daisuke Matsuda",
      "author_email": "matsuda-daisuke@fujitsu.com",
      "authored_date": "2023-11-02T19:23:34.000+09:00",
